      "id": "claim_f05388f725c046a89fae12a0350a8f7f",
      "statement": "The topolvm-thin-provisioner storage class is the cluster's default storage class, providing XFS filesystem with Immediate volume binding mode, volume expansion enabled, and targeting the 'thin' device class via the topolvm.io/device-class parameter.",
