      "statement": "The cluster deploys a VolumeSnapshotClass named 'topolvm-thin-provisioner' using the topolvm.io CSI driver with Delete deletion policy. It is configured as the default snapshot class and is managed through the snapshot-controller Helm chart (version 5.2.0).",
